# Normalize line endings to LF: this package is published to npm and installed
# on Linux/macOS, and CRLF in the repository pollutes diffs.
#
# Every text file is covered, lockfiles included — `text=auto` also normalizes
# the working tree before comparison, so a tool that rewrites a file with CRLF
# does not show up as a spurious modification.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files are never converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.tgz binary
